api_changes:
- Tenant Preferences API: POST /tenants/{id}/scheduler_prefs { "latency_percentile": "p95", "latency_weight": 0.7, "cost_weight": 0.3, "budget_mode": "soft" }
- Request metadata: new request header X-Redwood-SchedulerHints carrying preferred_action hints for SDKs.
- Observability: new metrics pref.sched.choice, pref.sched.estimated_utility, pref.sched.override_reasons.
